ter Supply Agreement\" is not registered in the OWM as an approved governing document. The procedure requires that if a request relies on a contract term that cannot be located, the document must be obtained before deciding. The discount cannot be approved, rejected, or escalated without first establishing what terms actually govern Acme's pricing.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"Claimed: Acme Master Supply Agreement (not registered in approved documents)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (EMP-200)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Request DR-9001 recorded in Northstar CRM\",\n    \"Sarah Chen confirmed as Enterprise Account Executive\",\n    \"Acme Manufacturing account identified (CRM-2048 / C-1001)\"\n    \n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement (referenced in request justification but not in OWM approved documents register)\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Obtain the Acme Master Supply Agreement and register it as an approved customer agreement if it covers NS-500 and 15% discount eligibility on the request date 2026-09-23\",\n      \"who\": \"Revenue Operations\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4531,"cache_read_input_tok